<span style="font-weight: 400;">So today we will talk about how to register for vaccine easily by following the simple steps given below. Nowadays a number of coronavirus arises a lot in India. Get yourself vaccinated by the following easy method.</span>

 

 

<!--more-->

 

**In India For Gujarat**

##### **Registration for vaccine for the age above 18 will be start from   ** **->  28 April**

##### **Vaccination for the age of above 18 will start from                           ** **->  1st May **

 

## **How to register for a vaccine ? **

 

<span style="font-weight: 400;">The registration for vaccines is done by two portals one of them is through the Aarogya Setu app and the second one is using the Co-win portal. here we are showing the Co-Win portal method for registration of vaccines. Following are the simple steps in order to register yourself for vaccine :</span>

<span style="font-weight: 400;">Step  1 ) Open up the website -> </span>[<span style="font-weight: 400;">CO-WIN</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> </span>][1]

<span style="font-weight: 400;">Step 2 ) Click on Register/ Sign in yourself.</span>

<span style="font-weight: 400;">Step 3 ) Enter your mobile number</span>

<span style="font-weight: 400;">Step 4 ) Verify the OTP</span>

<span style="font-weight: 400;">Step 5 ) Enter your basic details like name age gender and identity proof.</span>

<span style="font-weight: 400;">Step 6 ) Select the preferred vaccination centre and date.</span>

<span style="font-weight: 400;">Step 7 ) Visit the vaccination centre on the date you selected.</span>

 

### **For senior citizen**

 

<span style="font-weight: 400;">Senior citizen can register for vaccine using the call centre number 1507.  if you can&#8217;t able to register yourself then please visit nearest vaccination centre.</span>

